@startuml
title Proposed payment settlement and balance derivation
rectangle "Approved expense" {
 (Payer) as P
 (Participant A) as A
 (Participant B) as B
}
P --> A : expense payer credit
P --> B : expense payer credit
note right of P
Credit payer full amount;
debit participants their shares.
If payer participates, own share offsets credit.
end note
rectangle "PaymentService transaction" {
 (Read current obligation) as Read
 (Validate positive and <= due) as Validate
 (Persist payment) as Persist
 (Recompute / update derived balance) as Calc
}
Read --> Validate
Validate --> Persist : valid
Persist --> Calc
note bottom of Validate
Reject excess and report remaining due.
Serialize concurrent payments or use optimistic versioning.
Pairwise preservation vs group netting is open policy.
end note
@enduml
